// `hash-embed` — deterministic teaching adapter for the Tier-2
// embed-adapter contract.
//
// Composes `wild:embed-adapter/embed-adapter-plugin@0.1.0` verbatim —
// the same world the shipping adapters (`ollama-embed`, `llama-embed`)
// build on. The include inherits:
//
//   - `wild:plugin-meta/plugin-base@0.3.0` — the meta lifecycle
//     (`manifest` / `init` / `shutdown`) every Tier-2 plugin exports.
//   - `import wild:secrets/store@0.1.0` and
//     `import wild:http/outbound@0.1.0` — the typical embed-adapter
//     imports. This sample calls NEITHER (no network, no secrets);
//     wit-bindgen tree-shakes uncalled imports out of the built
//     component, so the binary imports nothing.
//   - `export embed` — `info()` (the capability profile) and the
//     one-shot batch `embed()` call. Embeddings have no streaming
//     sibling, so this is the whole export surface.
package wildstuff:hash-embed@0.1.0;

world hash-embed {
    include wild:embed-adapter/embed-adapter-plugin@0.1.0;
}
